<mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, our Newton-Raphson formula is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"96\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space